Package: totaljs-node
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: web
Priority: optional
Depends: ca-certificates, curl, xz-utils
Homepage: https://www.totaljs.com
Description: Node.js LTS and Total.js for the Total.js Developer Distros
 Installs the Node.js LTS release that is pinned in /usr/share/totaljs-node/versions
 (downloaded from nodejs.org and checked with its SHA-256), links it into
 /usr/local/bin, and installs total4 and total5 as global npm packages.
